      "summary_html": "<p>As Senator Adam Schiff pushes to rule out an AI bailout, NLW examines whether Washington could actually let the industry fail. He traces how AI became central to U.S. economic growth and national security under two administrations, then revisits the bank bailouts of 2008 to explore what a government rescue might look like if the AI boom collapses.</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>New Episode: How Anthropic Went from AI Safety Outcast to World's Most Important Company</strong></p><p>Spotify: <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/1MJpqbn3HWleuU9fUoeCX7\">\u2060\u2060\u2060https://open.spotify.com/episode/1MJpqbn3HWleuU9fUoeCX7\u2060\u2060\u2060</a>Apple: <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-anthropic-went-from-ai-safety-outcast-to-the/id6822359990?i=1000803569349\">\u2060\u2060\u2060https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-anthropic-went-from-ai-safety-outcast-to-the/id6822359990?i=1000803569349\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>Brought to you by:</strong></p><p><strong>KPMG</strong> \u2013 New KPMG and UT Austin research shows what separates \u201cAI Amplifiers\u201d from everyone else. Learn more at <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/us/en/articles/2026/ai-redefining-career-success-empower-your-talent-thrive.html?utm_source=the_ai_daily_brief&amp;utm_medium=native&amp;utm_content=podcast&amp;utm_campaign=701dV00000aMKrPQAW&amp;cid=701dV00000aMKrPQAW\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060kpmg.com/us/AIamplifiers\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Gartner</strong> - AI strategy, trends and insights - <a href=\"https://www.gartner.com/ai\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://www.gartne